{"title": "No Plan, No Trade", "type": "Trading mistake", "hooks": ["Stop clicking buy without a plan. Write these 4 things first.", "Write four things down before you buy. Most traders write none.", "No written plan? Then you'll make every exit in a panic."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop clicking buy without a plan. Write these 4 things first.", "text": "No plan? Don't click buy", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 94], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Trading without a plan", "show": 60, "vo": "Without a plan, every decision is made in the heat of the moment. You move stops, grab small wins, and hold losers, hoping.", "cues": [{"say": "heat of the moment", "do": "reveal", "to": 75}, {"say": "hold losers", "do": "shade", "from": 54, "to": 68, "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 94]}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Write it down first", "vo": "So before each trade, write down four things. Your entry. Your stop. Your target. And your size.", "items": [{"text": "Entry", "sub": "Where you get in", "icon": "chart"}, {"text": "Stop", "sub": "Where you are wrong", "icon": "shield"}, {"text": "Target", "sub": "Where you take profit", "icon": "check"}, {"text": "Size", "sub": "How much you risk", "icon": "coin"}], "cues": [{"say": "Your entry", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "Your stop", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "Your target", "do": "item", "i": 2}, {"say": "your size", "do": "item", "i": 3}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "What's the reward-to-risk?", "vo": "Here's a planned long, with the stop and target drawn. What's the reward-to-risk? One to one, one and a half, two, or three to one?", "win": [20, 94], "options": ["1 to 1", "1.5 to 1", "2 to 1", "3 to 1"], "answer": 2, "show": 90, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 195.67, "label": "Entry", "tone": "entry"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 191.92, "label": "Stop-loss", "tone": "stop"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "Two to one", "vo": "Two to one. The target is twice as far away as the stop. Here the stop was hit one candle later. A planned loss, nothing more.", "cues": [], "win": [20, 94], "reveal_to": 94, "carry": true}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Wrong twice, still break even", "vo": "At two to one, you can be wrong twice for every win and still break even, before fees.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Plan every trade", "vo": "On Meme Street, one-click brackets set your stop and target as you enter. Practise planning every trade at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Stop clicking buy without a plan. Write these four things first.\n\nWithout a plan, every decision is made in the heat of the moment.\nStops get moved, small wins get grabbed, losers get held.\nWrite down your entry, stop, target and size before each trade.\nAt 2 to 1, you can be wrong twice per win and still break even, before fees.\n\nSave this for your next trade.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #TradingPlan #RiskManagement #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[182.32, 184.65, 181.66, 184.15, 63992], [184.13, 184.31, 182.88, 183.95, 39572], [183.95, 184.79, 183.62, 184.55, 31055], [184.54, 185.76, 184.21, 185.2, 25911], [185.18, 185.69, 184.54, 185.68, 14898], [185.68, 186.17, 185.22, 185.34, 15431], [185.34, 186.43, 184.99, 186.25, 11363], [186.26, 190.34, 186.15, 190.31, 16597], [190.37, 190.89, 189.52, 190.8, 12577], [190.78, 193.12, 190.1, 192.2, 23020], [192.19, 192.19, 190.62, 191.68, 16137], [191.67, 192.68, 190.91, 191.74, 20636], [191.75, 192.76, 190.03, 190.55, 17419], [190.54, 191.07, 187.28, 187.94, 25074], [187.88, 189.55, 187.45, 189.36, 25862], [189.35, 193.56, 189.35, 193.42, 24681], [193.41, 193.8, 192.68, 193.41, 24050], [193.41, 195.8, 192.22, 195.53, 52988], [195.57, 196.01, 195.1, 195.86, 15554], [195.84, 201.05, 195.77, 200.88, 22302], [200.86, 201.19, 200.08, 201.19, 11780], [201.17, 204.78, 199.61, 201.8